{"title": "Hexblade's Curse (Condition)", "pageid": 49044, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hexblade's_Curse_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has status properties", "Bugs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Ethereal Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Hexblade's Curse</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Cursed by a Hexblade warlock. The warlock who cursed this entity adds their <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency bonus\">proficiency bonus</a> to damage rolls against them. The number they need to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">roll</a> a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> while attacking this entity is also reduced by 1. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/InitiateCombat\" title=\"Status properties/InitiateCombat\">InitiateCombat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/BringIntoCombat\" title=\"Status properties/BringIntoCombat\">BringIntoCombat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ApplyToDead\" title=\"Status properties/ApplyToDead\">ApplyToDead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Hexblade's Curse includes a <code>BoostContext</code> check of <code>OnAttack</code>.  Though this lacks an associated <code>BoostConditions</code> check, it causes a situation where the effect of this condition is inactive until the Warlock makes an initial attack.  This is most noticeable after reloading a save file in which the Warlock already has Hexblade's Curse applied to an enemy.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Hexblade.27s_Curse\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Hexblade's_Curse\">Sources of Hexblade's Curse</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"min-width: 30px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexed_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexed Weapon (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexed Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hexed_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexed Weapon (Condition)\">Hexed Weapon</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Hexblade%27s_Curse_Icon.webp/30px-Hexblade%27s_Curse_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Hexblade%27s_Curse_Icon.webp/45px-Hexblade%27s_Curse_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Hexblade%27s_Curse_Icon.webp/60px-Hexblade%27s_Curse_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexblade's Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Hexblade%27s_Curse_Icon.webp/30px-Hexblade%27s_Curse_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Hexblade%27s_Curse_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse\">Hexblade's Curse</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195206\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1630/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25071/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7927/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1130741/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.274      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   53.274      1 -total\n 63.90%   34.043      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 41.10%   21.898      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 25.36%   13.511      2 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 18.64%    9.929      1 Template:MdCond\n 16.87%    8.986      4 Template:Icon_link\n 15.87%    8.457      4 Template:Icon_text\n 14.09%    7.509     16 Template:Trim\n  8.85%    4.713      5 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:49044-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195206 and revision id 387879. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}